{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"1490","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"環署：月底前預告3項氣候法子法 協助碳盤查、規劃溫室氣體減量","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%92%B0%E4%BF%9D%E7%BD%B2(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">環保署今表示6月底前會預告3項氣候法子法，以利企業進行提案盤查及規劃溫室氣體減量工作。（記者陳嘉怡攝）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 0px; height: 1px; margin: 20px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2023/06/06 14:07</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">〔記者陳嘉怡／台北報導〕攸關我國淨零目標的「氣候變遷因應法」年初立院三讀通過，環保署預計半年內優先提出12項子法，今天宣布將在6月底前先預告3項子法，包含溫室氣體排放量盤查登錄管理辦法、溫室氣體增量抵換管理辦法、溫室氣體自願減量專案管理辦法，以利企業進行碳盤查，並規劃溫室氣體減量措施。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">環保署氣候署籌備處副主任黃偉鳴表示，6月底前會先預告三個氣候法子法，包含溫室氣體排放量盤查登錄管理辦法，溫室氣體增量抵換管理辦法、溫室氣體自願減量專案管理辦法。這三項子法都是溫室氣體減量的根本基礎，會清楚讓業者了解碳盤查登錄規定，新增的排放源要抵減、既有排放源要如何增量抵換，以及如何實施自願減量專案等，以利企業進行碳盤查，並規劃採行的溫室氣體減量措施。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">至於外界關切的碳費徵收，黃偉鳴表示，會在8月向各界預告費率審議委員會草案，並進行研商會，希望今年底完成所有法制，明年初費率審議會就能進行碳費費率審議，明年下半年開徵碳費。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">此外，為避免企業及民眾「碳焦慮」，環保署今日宣布設立「減碳專線」及電子信箱，若民眾或企業想進一步了解減碳議題，例如碳盤查、查驗、碳費徵收規劃，或歐盟碳邊境調整機制（CBAM）、碳匯、碳權、碳交易等，可撥打專線（02）2322-2050及電子信箱netzero@epa.gov.tw，有專人解答。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\">資料來源:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/life/breakingnews/4324944\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(197, 224, 180); text-decoration-line: none; outline: 0px !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/life/breakingnews/4324944</span></a></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2023-06-09","clk_count":"19"}},"__N_SSG":true}